usage: testpilot [-h] {run,targets,recheck,regression,compare} ...

positional arguments:
  {run,targets,recheck,regression,compare}
    run                 generate, run and repair tests for a diff
    targets             inspect changed functions without generating or
                        running tests
    recheck             rerun exact tests from a saved report without model
                        calls
    regression          check retained tests on two committed revisions
    compare             compare two saved reports without running tests or a
                        model

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
